# Microsoft Entra ID User and Group Management Lab

## Objective

Create and manage test users and security groups in Microsoft Entra ID and demonstrate basic identity administration and group membership management.

## Technologies
- Microsoft Entra ID
- Microsoft Entra admin center
- Microsoft 365

## Tasks
- Create test users
- Create a security group
- Add users to the security group
- Review group membership
- Review available administrative roles
- Apply the principle of least privilege

